"""Dependency Installer — CorkyTux plugin (v1.0.0).

Detects and installs missing Windows dependencies for games running
under Proton/Wine. Uses winetricks to install Visual C++ runtimes,
DirectX components, .NET frameworks, and other common dependencies.

Usage:
  dependency-installer scan <gamedir>
  dependency-installer install --prefix P [--proton PATH] dep1 [dep2 ...]

Commands:
  scan <gamedir>     Scan game directory for dependency hints, return
                     list of recommended deps as JSON.
  install            Install specified dependencies into the prefix.

Every command prints ONE JSON document on stdout.
Exit codes: 0 ok, 2 usage/invalid, 3 install failed.

Dependencies detected by scan:
  - vcrun2015    — Visual C++ 2015-2022 redistributable (universal)
  - vcrun2013    — Visual C++ 2013 redistributable
  - vcrun2012    — Visual C++ 2012 redistributable
  - vcrun2010    — Visual C++ 2010 redistributable
  - vcrun2008    — Visual C++ 2008 redistributable
  - d3dx9        — DirectX 9 runtime
  - d3dx11_43    — DirectX 11 runtime
  - d3dcompiler_47 — Direct3D shader compiler
  - dotnet48     — .NET Framework 4.8
  - dotnet35sp1  — .NET Framework 3.5 SP1
  - xact         — XACT audio engine
  - xinput       — XInput gamepad library
  -PhysX        — NVIDIA PhysX
"""
